title: mf trash
tags: [[CLI command]] Trash
kind: reference
summary: Trash-bin: safely trash a file, or restore/prune (default: list)

The repository's trash-bin ([[Trash]]). Alone, `mf trash` is `mf trash list`.

`mf trash -f <path>` (`--file`) trashes a tracked file or directory:
[[Sending files to the trash]]. It cannot be combined with a subcommand.
`--force` trashes even when another metarecord references one of those being
trashed; without it the refusal names the referrers and nothing is touched.
